0..72 Comment "// A model whose sorts are manifest where a model of its theory is asked"
73..147 Comment "// (#2120): a model type fixing sorts of a theory takes one forgetting map"
148..225 Comment "// from `Model(T) with sort C = x` to `Model(T)`, at every carrier `x`, which"
226..301 Comment "// puts each fixed sort back as the field it is in the theory\'s record. The"
302..376 Comment "// checker applies it where the one model stands at the other, solving `x`"
377..450 Comment "// from the model\'s type, and the run reads the application. The map is a"
451..528 Comment "// family in the carrier, so a manifest model carried along an equivalence of"
529..606 Comment "// carriers is read alike once forgotten. A model fixing some of its theory\'s"
607..684 Comment "// sorts takes the map putting back those alone, every other sort staying the"
685..708 Comment "// field it is (#2132)."
710..785 Comment "// The counter, counting up and down modulo three, the negation between the"
786..836 Comment "// counts, and `observe`, which reads any counter."
837..843 Keyword "import"
844..845 StringLit "\""
